MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1868938461}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1ab0524b487f2460ba85773f6a5c5e29, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial.TutorialManager
  tutorialTextTransform: {fileID: 479297444}
  tutorialText: {fileID: 1452989412}
  typewriter: {fileID: 1452989414}
  vendor: {fileID: 1487801262}
  background: {fileID: 863200047}
  dayTimeHud: {fileID: 305159693}
  statBars: {fileID: 8167570847187447527}
  encounterPanel: {fileID: 8020402563226318538}
  deckTransform: {fileID: 3912158634830620623}
  settingsButton: {fileID: 6063452940489433558}
  dayEndPanel: {fileID: 745274912435497748}
  challengeTutorialPosition: {fileID: 1686817635}
  dayEndTutorialPosition: {fileID: 1707549646}
  tutorialTexts:
  - 'Welcome to Benjamin Green & 960 Dwarfs.

    You are about to begin your first
    day. Listen carefully, watch your stats, and choose every deal with caution.'
  - This display shows the current day and hour. Every day starts at 10.00 and ends
    at 20.00. Every completed customer encounter moves time forward by one hour.
    When the day ends, daily effects are applied and a new day begins.
  - 'These bars represent your Happiness, Health, Storage, and Cash. Keep every stat
    balanced: reaching either zero or its maximum value ends the game. A highlighted
    bar indicates that the current offer can affect that stat immediately, helping
    you judge the risk before you decide.'
  - 'A vendor has arrived with an offer. Read the deal carefully, then choose whether
    to accept or reject it. Swipe up the correspending button to accept or reject
    the offer. Remember: vendors may not reveal the full truth, and some consequences
    appear later.'
  - "Before the day begins, choose a Challenge. Each Challenge gives you a special
    objective to complete over one or more days. The tracker shows your objective,
    progress, and reward. Complete it to gain an advantage\u2014but be careful, as
    failing a Challenge can put your run at risk. "
  - You can check your Challenge progress at any time by opening the Settings menu.
    Keep an eye on your objective and progress to make sure you are still on track.
  - At the end of each day, this panel summarizes what happened and applies your
    Daily Effects. These ongoing effects can change your stats before the next day
    starts. Review them carefully, keep your bars balanced, and prepare for the challenges
    ahead.
  - "Remember.\nEvery deal can change your future\u2014but not every vendor tells
    the truth. Keep your Happiness, Health, Storage, and Cash in balance. Choose
    carefully\u2026 and trust no one."
